d rubbing. The other hand is rubbing her breast. She blushes and pants heavily, approaching orgasm.\n\nShe then achieves an orgasm. She arches her back and screams loudly. Her height increases and her breasts expand. Lines or onomatopoeia depicting her growth are encouraged.\n\nFinally, she begins catching her breath. She is now far larger than the bed. She feels her bigger body with her hands and looks at herself with a face beaming with satisfaction.\n\nFeel free to decide details however sensei likes. Thank you very much.", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@n3n_7/works/60", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ee66efca/uploads/origins/5745d9f0-0c77-4ee6-9d8f-816ee533fe1a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12f46fd676e960d7f149763eeb40256e", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ee66efca/uploads/origins/5745d9f0-0c77-4ee6-9d8f-816ee533fe1a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=12f46fd676e960d7f149763eeb40256e, https://si.imgix.net/ee66efca/uploads/origins/5745d9f0-0c77-4ee6-9d8f-816ee533fe1a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7763feff43242156ab7f251e158fe4a2 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ee66efca/uploads/origins/5745d9f0-0c77-4ee6-9d8f-816ee533fe1a?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=8f7f0850b8dbaa0fda702937d2e644cc 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "初リクエスト失礼いたします。\n▼下記、依頼内容詳細です。\n・キャラクター：依頼者のOC(以降、OCと略します)\n　┗参考：https://imgur.com/NHG7F6i\n　　　　　https://x.com/Kaniko0751/status/1834946030548533619\n　※OCのおっぱいをマシマシにしてください。\n　　(私はおっぱいはデカければデカいほど好きな人なので超乳レベルでも全然OKです)\n\n・構図：こちらに向かって「お前次それやったらマジでこれだからな(パイズリのジェスチャー)」をしているOCをお願い致します。\n\n▼下記、余力がございましたらお願いいたします。\n・差分について：上記の構図の状態で全身パイズリをしているOCをお願い致します。\n\nそれ以外の内容につきましてはお任せ致します。\n\n以上、ご検討のほどよろしくお願いいたします。", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@n3n_7/works/59", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/81dff508/uploads/origins/9b914c1